# Pokoin/CardVault local environment template.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development and put real values only
# in `.env.local`, Vercel environment variables, Cloudflare Worker secrets,
# Hugging Face Space secrets, or Oracle/systemd environment files.
#
# Do not commit production endpoints, wallet addresses, private keys, API
# tokens, personal email addresses, local machine paths, or service IPs here.

